{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PVattmF1h-5qkNzc_y2zpQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.724680+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PVattmF1h-5qkNzc_y2zpQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>2027研招 | 上科大数学所接收2027年入学推免生通知</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span><font><span><span>上海科技大学数学</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>科学研究所</span></span></font></span></b><b><span><font><span><span>自即日起启动招收</span></span></font><font><span><span>2027</span></span></font><font><span><span>年入学推免研究生，欢迎全国各高校相关专业取得推荐免试资格的</span></span></font><font><span><span>2027</span></span></font><font><span><span>年应届本科毕业生踊跃报名！</span></span></font></span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span><span>1</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名方向及简介</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><span>070100 (学术学位) 数学</span></span><b><span></span></b></section><p><b><font><span><span>01.基础</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>数学</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>方向</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>本学科方向涵盖微分几何、表示论、几何分析、代数几何、偏微分方程、数论、数学物理等领域最活跃的研究方向，包括</span></span></font><font><span><span>\"朗兰兹纲领\"、\"同调镜像对称\"、\"卡拉比极值度量\"、\"非线性色散偏微分方程\"等。注重领域发展的内在动因和不同研究方向之间的交叉和融合。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><b><font><span><span>02.应用</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>数学方向</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>本学科方向涵盖数据科学、统计和概率、金融数学等研究方向。结合上科大在材料科学、光子科学、医学影像和生物医学医药等领域的特色优势，聚焦数据科学的数学理论研究和数学模型建立，如成像技术的理论模型和应用、脑科学与人类疾病研究中的数据分析等，以推动学科交叉合作，培养应用数学交叉人才。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><b><font><span><span>03.计算</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>数学方向</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>本学科方向涵盖数值计算、机器学习、随机分析及其应用等研究方向。基于基础数学理论，针对国家在数据科学、计算物理、材料科学、医学影像和生物医药等领域的不同需求，开发新型的计算、统计、数据分析和机器学习方法，在解决具体实际应用问题的同时推动数学理论发展，为国家培养计算数学的高层次人才。</span></span></font></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>02</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名条件</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.在本科高校</span><span>取得推荐免试资格</span><span>的2027年应届毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.有为科学事业献身的精神，有较好的科研潜力，良好的道德品质，遵纪守法，对报考方向有浓厚的兴趣及较强的潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，原则上本科所学专业主干课程无重修科目或补考记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.具有较强的外语听、说、读、写能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>8.身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>03</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>二维码：</span></span></strong></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/0uTibicr4UF3deGKBlEO8ckXFdsn5IicXqBTepCUiab79A5dudwTU8TwU00S2CMWRYpbHdlV3JRIYC7rb3pA30NkEVnJXicPJYibZcJjgtNgibkAS8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><font><span><span>报名网址：</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>https://gadmission.shanghaitech.edu.cn/enroll_student/</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>完成网上报名，并按要求在线提交电子版申请材料即完成全部报名流程。报名阶段不需要提供纸质材料。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span>    </span></font><span><font><span><span>报名截止</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>时间：2026年9月14日（含）</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span>填报指南：</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注册上科大研究生招生报名系统：https://gadmission.shanghaitech.edu.cn/enroll_student/登录后，选择【数学科学研究所】入口，点击【2027届】上海科技大学数学科学研究所2026年推免申请表中的【报名申请】；阅读弹窗申请表中的【活动介绍】和【报名须知】，报名时可提前联系感兴趣的导师进行沟通交流；填写弹窗申请表中的基本信息，最后在【网报材料】栏上传电子版材料；保存并提交报名信息，提交前检查信息，提交后无法修改</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>04</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名材料</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>请准备如下材料的彩色扫描件，并按照下述顺序将所有材料合并为一个 PDF 文件，文件命名为：姓名-身份证后四位-申请材料，提交至上述报名链接。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>A</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：必须提供的材料;</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.有效身份证件正反面;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.学生证 (照片、学号页即可)；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.本科成绩单（所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单），若有英文版请一并提供)</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.个人陈述与简历</span></span><font><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>中英文版本各一份，个人陈述侧重描述自己的科研能力和潜力，以及研究生阶段的科研及学习计划，字数不限）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.英语水平证明材料</span></span><font><span><span>(四六级证书等)。</span></span></font></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>B</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：自愿提供的材料（此项不做强制要求，考生可根据自身情况酌情选择是否提供）;</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>1. 获奖证书扫描件;</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. 其他能证明自身潜力的材料（</span></span><span><span>如在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其他原创性工作成果的复印件或证明</span></span><span><span>)。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3. 推荐信（</span></span><span><span>由副教授或相当职称及以上专家推荐，推荐专家直接发送至 ims@shanghaitech.edu.cn, 主题：XX大学XX同学推免推荐信</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>对申请有参考价值的其他材料。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>0</span></span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span><span>5</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>复试安排</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><font><span><span>1. 预计</span></span></font><span><span>9月</span></span><font><span><span>起开始邮件通知获得复试资格的同学以及分批复试时间，进入复试者将收到邮件通知，请留意报名阶段预留的邮箱。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>2. 复试形式：线上综合素质考核、线下专业</span></span></font><font><span><span>面试</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>3. 复试通过者，发拟接收函，将通过邮件向考生本人发布。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>4. 教育部网上报名：复试通过并且取得学校外推免试资格的同学，请于规定时间</span></span></font><span><span>按教育部网上报名要求进行报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>06</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>注意事项</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><span></span></section><p><font><span><span>1. 申请人必须保证全部申请材料的真实性和准确性。如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，将取消申请人面试资格。全部申请材料一经收到，概不退还。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>2. 获得我所推免生接收资格，且完成教育部网上推免填报的同学，不得再联系出国、就业及其他招生单位。</span></span></font></p><p><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>07</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>招生咨询</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>研究所官网：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><span>微信公众号：</span></span><font><span><br/></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>“IMS S</span></span></font><span><span>han</span></span><span><span>ghaiTe</span></span><span><span>ch</span></span><font><span><span>”</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>研究生招生咨询专用邮箱：</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><span><span>ims@shanghaitech.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>学费</span></span><font><span><span>与奖助信息</span></span></font><font><span><span>：</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>上海科技大学研究生根据录取类别，按学年缴纳学费。上海科技大学研究生奖助体系分为研究生国家奖学金、研究生学业奖学金、研究生国家助学金，校研究生等级奖学金和助研、助教与助管等三助项目。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>学费与奖助情况详见：</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><span><span>https://openinfo.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2026/0723/c20a1125734/page.htm</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2027届</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招生导师信息网页</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>丁之元：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2022/0916/c4741a842583/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>董俊斌：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/ims_en/2019/0711/c4742a43657/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>葛淑菲：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2021/0219/c4741a59495/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Yohsuke Imagi</span></span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2018/1110/c4741a35989/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>姜嘉骅：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2025/0901/c4741a1114641/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>蒋诗晓：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2020/1029/c4741a57012/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>李龙：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/ims_en/2020/0117/c4742a50083/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>马骐骁：</span></span><span><span><span>https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/ims_en/2023/0913/c4742a1082118/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Manuel Rissel</span></span></span><span><span>：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2025/0901/c4741a1118225/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>秦玲：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2025/0901/c4741a1114637/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>刘翀：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2022/0825/c4741a791035/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>Daniel Skodlerack</span></span></span><span><span>：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2018/1110/c4741a35985/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>汪湜：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2018/1110/c4741a705382/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>汪时嘉：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2024/0119/c4741a1087894/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>张正：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2020/0730/c4741a54467/page.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>翟佳羽：https://ims.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2022/0913/c4741a835499/page.htm</span></span></p><p><u><span><span><br/></span></span></u><span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><strong><span><span>08</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>其他</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/WJrnMz2jfovMW1YO3f4zlZ1KBTMV2hxNT80jfrqfnupMFR6eXWUO3AjEL0QKyPU24yDxc0NbiaKIxwbGdMhmCnw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><font><span><span>本通知如有与国家新出台的招生政策或上海市相关文件不符的事项，以上级单位新政策或文件要求为准。</span></span></font></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/WJrnMz2jfosb83PfBiazXsHTZk3L54f4aF7XcKv0giabGics9cApv7KHLlPqkZfqzeOibGeasmpjyOQM6H3oe7oI1Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1ab6b031138998926d48d6077b6b3b4fe51334e6adca2ea92161c9e7215d0864","textLength":3396,"sourceSha256":"870f057d32f59c1ba21bb3fe1f97a4ba5a453f2f01c41007d8360fe9739aaf31","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7466d75e7742995605a2","title":"2026年上海科技大学数学科学研究所2027研招上海科技大学数学科学研究所接收2027年入学推免生通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:49.724680+00:00"}
